  class lg0 breaks
  class lg1 bugPath
  s0: Not recording | gate off in the page
  s1: Recording | gate off in the page (switch-on on its way)
  s2: Recording | gate ON in the page
  s3: Recording | gate ON in the page | click 1: held back, no 'before' yet#59; no report#59; not in the timeline
  s4: Wrapping up to save | gate ON in the page (switch-off on its way) | click 1: held back, no 'before' yet#59; no report#59; not in the timeline
  s5: Wrapping up to save | gate ON in the page (switch-off on its way) | click 1: held back, 'before' taken#59; no report#59; not in the timeline
  s6: Wrapping up to save | gate ON in the page (switch-off on its way) | click 1: reached the page#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline
  s7: Wrapping up to save | gate off in the page | click 1: reached the page#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline
  s8: Saving | gate off in the page | click 1: reached the page#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline
  s9: Saving | gate off in the page | package writing | click 1: reached the page#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you press Record
  s1 --> s2: the page switches the gate on
  s2 --> s3: you click (click 1): the gate holds it back
  s3 --> s4: you press Finish
  s4 --> s5: the recorder takes the 'before' of click 1
  s5 --> s6: the recorder passes click 1 on to the page
  s6 --> s7: the page switches the gate off
  s7 --> s8: the recorder finishes wrapping up
  s8 --> s9: the recorder starts writing the package
